  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1800\n\n#6482-B, eff 4-1-97 (formerly Env-C 400)\n\n#8304, eff 3-15-05\n\nREVISION NOTE #2:\n\nDocument #12172, effective 5-5-17, adopted, readopted, readopted with amendments, or repealed all of the rules in Chapter Env-A 1800, which involved extensive renumbering within the chapter. Document #12172 replaced all prior filings for rules in the former Chapter Env-A 1800.\n\nDocument #10695, effective 10-18-14, was the only prior filing affecting rules in the former Chapter Env-A 1800 since Document #9298, effective 10-21-08. Those rules in the former Env-A 1800 which were not affected by Document #9298 did not expire on 10-21-16 since they were extended pursuant to RSA 541-A:14-a until replaced by the rules in Document #12172, effective 5-5-17.\n\nREVISION NOTE #3:\n\nDocument #14104, effective 11-1-24, readopted with amendments Chapter Env-A 1800. Amendments included inserting new rules, deleting rules, amending rules, and extensively renumbering the remaining rules within the chapter, which had contained Part Env-A 1801 through Part Env-A 1814 but now contained Part Env-A 1801 through Part Env-A 1820. Document #14104 replaces all prior filings for rules in the former Chapter Env-A 1800.\n\nThe new rules inserted as amendments to Env-A 1800 by Document #14104 include the following definitions in Part Env-A 1802:",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1800.html"
